Dear Sir/Madam,

I am applying to vote abroad, and for that purpose I am enclosing:
1. a request for entry into the unified voter register of the Republic of Serbia;
2. a request for entry of the information that I will vote abroad into the voter register;
3. a copy of a valid identification document of the Republic of Serbia.

Also, pursuant to Paragraph 4 of Article 16 of the Law on the Unified Voter Register, I request to be informed about the data entered about me in the voter register.
